//!
//! # Format Module
//!
//! Formatting traits for user-defined textual representations.
//!
//! ## Exports
//!
//! | Export    | Description                                               |
//! |-----------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
//! | `Display` | `display(&self): String`, with a reflective record default and implementations for primitives, `str`, `String`, `Option` and `Vector` |
//!
//! ## Example
//!
//! ```ignis
//! @implements(Display)
//! record Point {
//!   public x: i32;
//!   public label: String;
//! }
//!
//! let point: Point = Point { x: 1, label: String::create("origin") };
//! let text: String = point.display(); // Point { x: 1, label: origin }
//! ```
//!
//! Enums still need a hand-written `display`: the default walks record
//! fields only (see `std::format::display`).

export Display from "./display";
